# The Throne Room's Shadow Lord (battlefield 160) by a Windurstian on The Shadow Awaits at status 3: _4l1 32000, area 3;
# phase 1 killed: its death plays 32004 (3), whose finish (onEventFinishBattlefield) despawns phase 1 and spawns phase 2
# with the char's enmity; phase 2 (unkillable) takes the blow at 1 HP; after two days (wait jst=1 twice) he acts (an
# 028) and drops, the next tick has him dead: WON, 32001; its finish runs the battlefield's (Shadow Banisher) and the
# mission's (The New Frontier added: the engine's warning over the 65535 Zilart row; PostBattle 1; the set-down, whose
# zone change shows at the next tick 400); the zone-in 7 and its finishes (the mission's; Zone.lua's set-down in Castle
# Zvahl Baileys at the next tick 400).
lists ThroneRoom/_4l1/onTrigger ThroneRoom/_4l2/onTrigger ThroneRoom/onZoneIn/1 ThroneRoom/onEventUpdate/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32001 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32002 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32003 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32004 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/6 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/7
char zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
warning: lua: addMission: overwriting current mission 65535 of log 3 with 0 -- the 32001 finish adds Zilart's The New Frontier while the char's Zilart log holds 65535 (no Zilart row yet): the engine's C++ ShowWarning, the mission is added
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
mission Windurst ToEachHisOwnRight completed
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
mission Windurst ANewJourney completed
mission Windurst Magicite completed
mission Windurst TheFinalSeal completed
mission Windurst TheShadowAwaits current
login
missionstatus Windurst 3
trigger _4l1                            # status 3: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=3                   # area 3: entered
finish
tick 2000                               # the first tick: phase 1 spawns; not locked yet
kill SHADOW_LORD_RANK_5_OFFSET+2        # phase 1 dead: the group's death: 32004 (3)
finish                                  # 32004: onEventFinishBattlefield: phase 1 despawned, phase 2 spawned
tick 2000
kill SHADOW_LORD_RANK_5_OFFSET+5        # phase 2 (unkillable) takes the blow: 1 HP
tick 1000                               # nothing yet
wait jst=1                              # the wall clock a day on
tick 1000
tick 1000
wait jst=1
tick 1000                               # the second day: phase 2 acts (an 028), HP 0
tick 1000                               # phase 2 dead: WON, 32001
tick 1000                               # nothing
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish                                  # 32001: the title; The Shadow Awaits: Zilart 1-1 added, PostBattle 1, setPos
tick 400                                # the setPos runs: a zone change into the Throne Room
login open                              # status 3, PostBattle 1: the zone-in's 7 (-1, flags 8)
finish                                  # 7: status 4, PostBattle 0, the Shadow Fragment
tick 400                                # Zone.lua 7 finish: setPos to Castle Zvahl Baileys, a zone change
login
